 To apply a Gaussian filter before the Sobel edge detection in MATLAB, you need to add the gaussian filtering step before the application of the Sobel operators. Here's the modified code:
```matlab
% Read input image
input_image = imread('image.jpg');
% Convert to grayscale
gray_image = rgb2gray(input_image);
